294
00:16:09,980 --> 00:16:11,700
Constable Iron, Lord Yan.

295
00:16:11,870 --> 00:16:13,200
Thank you for your help

296
00:16:13,200 --> 00:16:15,200
at the dock today.

297
00:16:15,480 --> 00:16:16,270
I am

298
00:16:17,030 --> 00:16:18,150
extremely grateful.

299
00:16:17,860 --> 00:16:19,670
[Prosperous and Flourishing]

300
00:16:18,240 --> 00:16:19,030
Boss Ji.

301
00:16:19,840 --> 00:16:20,600
Today at the Hound Pit,

302
00:16:20,600 --> 00:16:21,840
to attract gamblers,

303
00:16:21,840 --> 00:16:22,510
you deliberately arranged

304
00:16:22,510 --> 00:16:23,870
for a young girl to fight.

305
00:16:23,870 --> 00:16:25,960
Do you know this is
an immoral way to make money

306
00:16:25,960 --> 00:16:27,240
and a total disregard for human life?

307
00:16:27,240 --> 00:16:29,080
You are mistaken, My Lady.

308
00:16:29,550 --> 00:16:30,960
You all saw it.

309
00:16:31,200 --> 00:16:32,670
That girl today

310
00:16:33,000 --> 00:16:34,800
not only wasn't beaten to death,

311
00:16:34,840 --> 00:16:36,150
but she also won.

312
00:16:36,240 --> 00:16:37,150
Besides,

313
00:16:37,170 --> 00:16:38,410
she fought in the ring

314
00:16:38,600 --> 00:16:40,360
completely voluntarily.

315
00:16:40,390 --> 00:16:42,750
She was even rewarded
with a gold pendant afterwards.

316
00:16:42,740 --> 00:16:46,410
[Prosperous and Flourishing]

317
00:16:42,840 --> 00:16:43,840
Moreover,

318
00:16:43,840 --> 00:16:46,550
she is a servant of my Ji family.

319
00:16:46,670 --> 00:16:48,080
Her life belongs to my family.

320
00:16:48,080 --> 00:16:49,390
Does it matter

321
00:16:49,630 --> 00:16:51,150
if she fights a round?

322
00:16:51,390 --> 00:16:52,670
In your eyes,

323
00:16:53,550 --> 00:16:54,750
is a servant's life

324
00:16:55,440 --> 00:16:56,840
not a life?

325
00:16:56,870 --> 00:16:58,600
Heaven, be my witness!

326
00:16:59,840 --> 00:17:00,870
Back then,

327
00:17:01,150 --> 00:17:03,390
her mother was bitten to death by wolves.

328
00:17:03,390 --> 00:17:05,000
If I hadn't gone hunting in the mountains

329
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:06,030
and happened to come across her,

330
00:17:06,030 --> 00:17:08,160
no one would have collected her body.

331
00:17:09,400 --> 00:17:11,270
I took her in as a servant

332
00:17:11,400 --> 00:17:13,750
precisely because
she was alone and helpless.

333
00:17:13,750 --> 00:17:14,829
She was truly pitiful,

334
00:17:14,829 --> 00:17:16,550
so I wanted to give her a bite to eat.

335
00:17:16,550 --> 00:17:18,750
Why is it that in your words,

336
00:17:18,829 --> 00:17:20,750
I have become a villain?

337
00:17:20,960 --> 00:17:23,420
You collected Xia Jiuying's mother's body?

338
00:17:23,550 --> 00:17:25,030
She is still looking for
her mother's remains.

339
00:17:25,030 --> 00:17:25,960
Why didn't you tell her

340
00:17:25,960 --> 00:17:26,829
where she is buried?

341
00:17:26,829 --> 00:17:28,240
She is just a fool!

342
00:17:28,310 --> 00:17:29,070
She's already dead.

343
00:17:29,070 --> 00:17:30,870
What's the use of a pile of bones?

344
00:17:31,160 --> 00:17:32,640
Mount Fuyao is so big,

345
00:17:33,070 --> 00:17:34,110
who remembers

346
00:17:34,350 --> 00:17:35,920
where she is buried?

347
00:17:51,400 --> 00:17:52,370
Boss Ji, what you said

348
00:17:52,370 --> 00:17:53,740
makes so much sense.

349
00:17:54,960 --> 00:17:55,930
So,

350
00:17:56,440 --> 00:17:57,640
if one day

351
00:17:57,860 --> 00:17:59,570
you die an unnatural death,

352
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:01,960
and someone digs up your grave

353
00:18:01,980 --> 00:18:03,380
to scatter your remains,

354
00:18:04,240 --> 00:18:05,830
it wouldn't matter either.

355
00:18:06,480 --> 00:18:07,270
Right?

356
00:18:10,480 --> 00:18:12,080
Divine Constable Qingyang.

357
00:18:12,440 --> 00:18:15,170
Even if you are from
the Divine Constable Bureau,

358
00:18:16,960 --> 00:18:20,750
how can you curse me like that?

359
00:18:30,240 --> 00:18:31,200
Isn't this what Boss Ji

360
00:18:31,200 --> 00:18:33,270
just said yourself?

361
00:18:34,030 --> 00:18:35,330
Since she's dead,

362
00:18:36,200 --> 00:18:37,830
what's the use of her bones?

363
00:18:45,240 --> 00:18:46,770
Didn't he say that himself?

364
00:18:48,730 --> 00:18:50,110
-Second Master.
-Get out of the way!

365
00:18:50,110 --> 00:18:50,680
Second Master.

366
00:18:50,680 --> 00:18:51,640
This is my home.

367
00:18:51,640 --> 00:18:52,720
Why can't I walk around?

368
00:18:52,720 --> 00:18:54,710
-Master doesn’t allow you to walk around.
-I want to see the Divine Constable.

369
00:18:54,710 --> 00:18:55,720
Second Master!

370
00:18:55,960 --> 00:18:57,260
-Let's go back.
-Divine Constable!

371
00:18:57,260 --> 00:19:00,120
-Let's go back, Second Master.
-Divine Constable!

372
00:19:05,580 --> 00:19:06,580
My Lords.

373
00:19:07,010 --> 00:19:08,540
That is my younger brother.

374
00:19:08,640 --> 00:19:09,790
He has a chronic illness.

375
00:19:09,790 --> 00:19:12,270
Normally, he's not allowed to interfere

376
00:19:12,270 --> 00:19:13,930
in any affairs in the mansion.

377
00:19:14,000 --> 00:19:15,790
I don't know what's wrong with him today.

378
00:19:15,790 --> 00:19:18,640
I'm afraid he might offend you, My Lords.

379
00:19:18,960 --> 00:19:20,490
I must go check on him first.

380
00:19:20,750 --> 00:19:22,000
Since Boss Ji has family matters

381
00:19:22,000 --> 00:19:22,830
to deal with,

382
00:19:22,830 --> 00:19:23,640
we won't

383
00:19:24,550 --> 00:19:25,880
bother you anymore.

384
00:19:26,070 --> 00:19:27,830
Boss Ji, after you settle your brother,

385
00:19:27,830 --> 00:19:29,030
come to the county office.

386
00:19:29,030 --> 00:19:31,160
There is something we need to confirm.

387
00:19:31,240 --> 00:19:32,000
Okay.

388
00:19:42,240 --> 00:19:43,240
Well, Qingyang,

389
00:19:43,550 --> 00:19:45,010
you were really not polite

390
00:19:45,240 --> 00:19:46,830
to Boss Ji.

391
00:19:47,210 --> 00:19:48,610
This man is greedy

392
00:19:48,640 --> 00:19:49,720
and shameless.

393
00:19:50,240 --> 00:19:51,770
I was actually being polite

394
00:19:52,000 --> 00:19:53,240
to him just now.

395
00:19:53,480 --> 00:19:54,270
Let's go.

396
00:19:55,830 --> 00:19:58,460
[Remain At Ease]

397
00:19:59,160 --> 00:20:00,090
There's no need!

398
00:20:00,270 --> 00:20:01,790
How many times have I told you?

399
00:20:01,790 --> 00:20:03,920
You are not allowed
to meddle in the mansion's affairs.

400
00:20:03,920 --> 00:20:04,720
Brother.

401
00:20:04,830 --> 00:20:06,640
Is it true that you secretly
opened a gambling den?

402
00:20:06,640 --> 00:20:07,440
Close it.

403
00:20:07,440 --> 00:20:08,880
I will go plead with
the Divine Constable Bureau.

404
00:20:08,880 --> 00:20:12,000
-Considering Princess Ding's...
-I told you, there's no need!

405
00:20:12,000 --> 00:20:13,550
Those officials from Tianhuang City

406
00:20:13,550 --> 00:20:14,480
won't make trouble

407
00:20:14,480 --> 00:20:15,640
for our Ji family

408
00:20:15,640 --> 00:20:17,160
over a mere gambling den.

409
00:20:17,160 --> 00:20:17,830
Brother.

410
00:20:18,030 --> 00:20:19,240
We cannot do things

411
00:20:19,240 --> 00:20:21,040
-that violate the law.
-Shut up!

412
00:20:26,000 --> 00:20:26,880
Yun.

413
00:20:28,500 --> 00:20:31,150
[Old Madam Gong]

414
00:20:29,160 --> 00:20:30,070
Hao.

415
00:20:32,500 --> 00:20:33,670
Chen.

416
00:20:36,770 --> 00:20:38,430
Chen...

417
00:20:39,640 --> 00:20:40,440
Grandma.

418
00:20:40,790 --> 00:20:41,590
Grandma.

419
00:20:42,310 --> 00:20:43,780
What are you yelling for?

420
00:20:45,400 --> 00:20:46,480
Didn't you hear

421
00:20:46,480 --> 00:20:48,550
my children talking?

422
00:20:50,350 --> 00:20:51,960
They said they were tired

423
00:20:52,310 --> 00:20:53,110
and wanted to

424
00:20:53,110 --> 00:20:54,710
lie down and get a good sleep.

425
00:21:00,770 --> 00:21:01,810
Who are you?

426
00:21:05,730 --> 00:21:06,520
Grandma,

427
00:21:07,360 --> 00:21:09,360
I am your grandson,

428
00:21:09,510 --> 00:21:10,310
Gong Le.

429
00:21:13,510 --> 00:21:15,070
Why did you run out again?

430
00:21:20,960 --> 00:21:23,350
Old Madam, Old Madam.

431
00:21:24,160 --> 00:21:26,070
Didn't we agree?

432
00:21:26,200 --> 00:21:27,480
If you refuse to listen

433
00:21:27,480 --> 00:21:29,010
and continue to run around,

434
00:21:30,070 --> 00:21:31,480
then your grandson

435
00:21:32,040 --> 00:21:33,980
will have to take a beating for you.

436
00:21:38,960 --> 00:21:40,620
Old Madam, watch out.

437
00:21:40,720 --> 00:21:41,960
The whip might hit you.

438
00:21:41,960 --> 00:21:42,720
Stop hitting him.

439
00:21:42,720 --> 00:21:43,400
Stop hitting

440
00:21:43,400 --> 00:21:44,440
my grandson...

441
00:21:47,480 --> 00:21:48,480
My grandson.

442
00:21:48,480 --> 00:21:49,790
M-My grandson!

443
00:21:49,790 --> 00:21:50,920
S-Stop hitting him!

444
00:21:51,390 --> 00:21:52,390
Stop it!

445
00:21:52,750 --> 00:21:53,920
I... I was wrong.

446
00:21:53,920 --> 00:21:55,590
I was wrong. Stop hitting him.

447
00:21:55,610 --> 00:21:57,260
I'm scared.

448
00:21:57,290 --> 00:21:59,430
-Take Old Madam away
-I’m scared!

449
00:21:59,450 --> 00:22:00,490
for some rest.

450
00:22:00,630 --> 00:22:01,980
Let's go, Old Madam.

451
00:22:02,350 --> 00:22:03,070
N-No.

452
00:22:03,070 --> 00:22:04,400
Don't look anymore.

453
00:22:04,400 --> 00:22:06,510
-I’m scared.
-Let’s go back and rest.

454
00:22:07,200 --> 00:22:08,180
Stop hitting him.

455
00:22:08,180 --> 00:22:09,360
Stop hitting him.

456
00:22:17,110 --> 00:22:19,610
[Coroner's Office]

457
00:22:25,880 --> 00:22:26,680
Zhe Shan.

458
00:22:27,400 --> 00:22:28,200
That's right.

459
00:22:28,510 --> 00:22:29,940
He is Zhe Shan.

460
00:22:30,240 --> 00:22:31,750
Are you sure?

461
00:22:32,150 --> 00:22:34,000
I recognize his clothes.

462
00:22:34,000 --> 00:22:36,000
He also developed cauliflower ears

463
00:22:36,200 --> 00:22:37,400
from the numerous injuries

464
00:22:37,400 --> 00:22:39,330
he sustained in the fighting ring.

465
00:22:39,400 --> 00:22:40,260
No need to look.

466
00:22:40,830 --> 00:22:41,680
It's him.

467
00:22:42,920 --> 00:22:44,010
You just said

468
00:22:44,030 --> 00:22:45,660
he didn't drown.

469
00:22:45,790 --> 00:22:46,550
Then,

470
00:22:47,240 --> 00:22:49,000
how exactly did he die?

471
00:22:49,030 --> 00:22:50,490
Regarding this question,

472
00:22:50,510 --> 00:22:51,880
we also want to know.

473
00:22:52,570 --> 00:22:54,770
That's why we invited you here, Boss Ji.

474
00:22:59,350 --> 00:23:00,160
Zhe Shan

475
00:23:00,720 --> 00:23:02,830
was a first-class boxer
of the Ji family.

476
00:23:02,830 --> 00:23:04,160
You must know

477
00:23:04,550 --> 00:23:05,830
something about him, right?

478
00:23:05,830 --> 00:23:06,640
Of course.

479
00:23:07,350 --> 00:23:09,240
Zhe Shan was an old member
of my household.

480
00:23:09,240 --> 00:23:11,100
He had been with me for many years.

481
00:23:11,440 --> 00:23:13,550
Other than being fond of picking fights

482
00:23:13,550 --> 00:23:14,310
and bragging,

483
00:23:14,310 --> 00:23:15,960
he didn’t have any major faults.

484
00:23:15,960 --> 00:23:16,750
However,

485
00:23:17,110 --> 00:23:18,680
he was highly skilled.

486
00:23:18,790 --> 00:23:20,510
To expand the Hound Pit's business,

487
00:23:20,510 --> 00:23:22,200
I let him fight in the ring.

488
00:23:22,270 --> 00:23:23,070
Oh, right.

489
00:23:23,640 --> 00:23:25,590
He did have a habit.

490
00:23:26,350 --> 00:23:28,350
Whenever he won money from fighting,

491
00:23:28,350 --> 00:23:30,270
he'd go to Yulu Hall in town

492
00:23:30,440 --> 00:23:31,570
to drink with women,

493
00:23:31,960 --> 00:23:33,960
and wouldn't return until late at night.

494
00:23:33,960 --> 00:23:34,960
So annoying.

495
00:23:35,030 --> 00:23:36,030
Make sure you come on time.

496
00:23:36,030 --> 00:23:36,790
You must come.

497
00:23:36,790 --> 00:23:39,830
-What nonsense about being invincible?
-Remember to miss us.

498
00:23:39,830 --> 00:23:43,270
I, Zhe Shan, am invincible in the world!

499
00:23:44,200 --> 00:23:46,310
-Who dares to disagree?
-Normally,

500
00:23:46,310 --> 00:23:47,720
with Zhe Shan's skills,

501
00:23:47,720 --> 00:23:48,350
ordinary people

502
00:23:48,350 --> 00:23:50,080
couldn't even get close to him.

503
00:23:50,310 --> 00:23:52,400
Only when he was walking alone and drunk

504
00:23:52,400 --> 00:23:54,610
was it the best time to strike.

505
00:23:55,160 --> 00:23:56,750
To destroy the evidence,

506
00:23:56,790 --> 00:23:57,650
the killer then

507
00:23:57,720 --> 00:23:59,590
threw the body into the Yan River.

508
00:24:01,200 --> 00:24:02,110
Boss Ji.

509
00:24:02,920 --> 00:24:04,720
That's a very good deduction.

510
00:24:06,000 --> 00:24:08,000
As for who the killer is,

511
00:24:08,000 --> 00:24:09,350
it's hard to say.

512
00:24:09,590 --> 00:24:11,050
After all, over the years,

513
00:24:11,510 --> 00:24:13,720
Zhe Shan defeated

514
00:24:13,790 --> 00:24:15,030
countless people.

515
00:24:15,550 --> 00:24:17,610
Since they couldn't beat him openly,

516
00:24:17,640 --> 00:24:19,590
they could only

517
00:24:19,750 --> 00:24:21,680
resort to dirty tricks in the dark.

518
00:24:27,440 --> 00:24:28,240
Boss Ji.

519
00:24:29,030 --> 00:24:30,590
Did Zhe Shan and Gong Sihai

520
00:24:30,590 --> 00:24:31,510
have any grudges?

521
00:24:31,510 --> 00:24:32,550
Gong Sihai?

522
00:24:34,960 --> 00:24:36,000
Do you mean

523
00:24:36,000 --> 00:24:38,000
Gong Sihai killed Zhe Shan?

524
00:24:38,240 --> 00:24:39,510
This is an official questioning.

525
00:24:39,510 --> 00:24:41,070
Just answer the question.

526
00:24:41,440 --> 00:24:42,570
Stop overthinking.

527
00:24:44,790 --> 00:24:45,960
You all saw what happened

528
00:24:45,960 --> 00:24:47,090
at the dock that day.

529
00:24:47,750 --> 00:24:50,160
The Gong family has always been bullies,

530
00:24:50,240 --> 00:24:52,000
especially the subordinates.

531
00:24:52,200 --> 00:24:53,730
They always act out of line.

532
00:24:54,310 --> 00:24:55,960
Every time, Zhe Shan stepped forward

533
00:24:55,960 --> 00:24:57,200
to teach them a lesson.

534
00:24:57,200 --> 00:24:59,200
Isn't that a slap in the face to them?

535
00:24:59,790 --> 00:25:00,590
In my opinion,

536
00:25:00,790 --> 00:25:02,510
Gong Sihai must have

537
00:25:02,720 --> 00:25:03,550
felt that my men

538
00:25:03,550 --> 00:25:05,350
were more capable than his,

539
00:25:05,610 --> 00:25:06,880
so he deliberately took revenge

540
00:25:06,880 --> 00:25:08,310
and killed Zhe Shan.

541
00:25:08,310 --> 00:25:09,160
It's not

542
00:25:09,160 --> 00:25:10,510
impossible.

543
00:25:11,830 --> 00:25:14,160
Thank you for making the trip, Boss Ji.

544
00:25:14,720 --> 00:25:17,160
Go back and rest early.

545
00:25:20,830 --> 00:25:22,350
I'll take my leave.

546
00:25:23,160 --> 00:25:24,110
My Lords,

547
00:25:24,590 --> 00:25:25,640
if there is anything

548
00:25:25,640 --> 00:25:26,880
I can do for you,

549
00:25:27,110 --> 00:25:28,590
just let me know.

550
00:25:29,400 --> 00:25:31,200
Outside Mingling County,

551
00:25:31,200 --> 00:25:32,330
I can't say for sure.

552
00:25:35,790 --> 00:25:37,680
But in this territory,

553
00:25:38,790 --> 00:25:40,790
I still have the final say.

554
00:25:48,990 --> 00:25:52,940
[Coroner's Office]

555
00:25:52,510 --> 00:25:53,310
Master.

556
00:25:55,110 --> 00:25:57,550
Bah! Who do you think you are?

557
00:25:55,650 --> 00:25:57,220
[Coroner's Office]

558
00:25:57,590 --> 00:25:59,850
Our county magistrate has the final say.

559
00:26:07,110 --> 00:26:07,920
My Lord.

560
00:26:07,970 --> 00:26:09,210
You asked me to check

561
00:26:09,250 --> 00:26:10,710
the travel permit records

562
00:26:10,750 --> 00:26:12,350
for people coming from
Tianhuang City to Mingling County

563
00:26:12,350 --> 00:26:13,920
in the 20th year of Hongyun.

564
00:26:14,790 --> 00:26:16,850
I looked through them several times,

565
00:26:16,960 --> 00:26:18,350
and none of the permits

566
00:26:18,350 --> 00:26:20,280
had the seal of the Ministry of War.

567
00:26:21,350 --> 00:26:22,410
No travel permits?

568
00:26:23,550 --> 00:26:25,230
Without permits, could it be

569
00:26:25,590 --> 00:26:28,050
that they went straight
into the mountains?

570
00:26:28,350 --> 00:26:29,200
Well...

571
00:26:29,720 --> 00:26:31,180
Mingling County is small,

572
00:26:31,310 --> 00:26:33,640
and there are no military camps
or city defenses around.

573
00:26:33,640 --> 00:26:35,160
It's reasonable for
the Ministry of War officials

574
00:26:35,160 --> 00:26:36,240
from Tianhuang City

575
00:26:36,240 --> 00:26:37,570
to not visit for months.

576
00:26:37,680 --> 00:26:38,480
Also,

577
00:26:38,640 --> 00:26:41,000
there was an epidemic
in the county that year.

578
00:26:41,000 --> 00:26:43,000
It was impossible for outsiders to move

579
00:26:43,000 --> 00:26:44,600
to our county at that time...

580
00:26:45,090 --> 00:26:46,550
Except for the Ji family.

581
00:26:47,400 --> 00:26:48,200
The Ji family?

582
00:26:52,200 --> 00:26:54,000
The Ji family also
moved to Mingling County

583
00:26:54,000 --> 00:26:55,330
in the 20th year of Hongyun?

584
00:26:55,330 --> 00:26:56,310
Yes.

585
00:26:56,530 --> 00:26:58,390
The county annals can't be wrong.

586
00:26:59,110 --> 00:26:59,920
My Lord.

587
00:26:59,920 --> 00:27:01,230
As for the travel permit,

588
00:27:01,230 --> 00:27:03,830
I will look into the records
from other months.

589
00:27:04,200 --> 00:27:05,000
No need.

590
00:27:09,790 --> 00:27:11,990
I will keep an eye on this matter myself.

591
00:27:13,280 --> 00:27:13,610
[Mingling County Government]

592
00:27:13,350 --> 00:27:14,200
Xiu Niang.

593
00:27:14,240 --> 00:27:17,540
[Mingling County Government]

594
00:27:14,350 --> 00:27:14,960
Master.

595
00:27:14,960 --> 00:27:16,720
Instead of taking care
of the Second Master at home,

596
00:27:16,720 --> 00:27:18,050
what are you doing here?

597
00:27:18,430 --> 00:27:19,230
Master.

598
00:27:23,920 --> 00:27:24,720
Brother.

599
00:27:27,200 --> 00:27:28,130
Second Brother.

600
00:27:29,590 --> 00:27:30,590
Why are you here?

601
00:27:31,510 --> 00:27:32,920
I was worried about you.

602
00:27:33,110 --> 00:27:34,590
How many times have I told you

603
00:27:34,590 --> 00:27:36,520
not to meddle in external affairs?

604
00:27:37,000 --> 00:27:38,790
But today is different.

605
00:27:40,160 --> 00:27:41,800
The Divine Constable Bureau
is here this time.

606
00:27:41,800 --> 00:27:47,190
[Mingling County Government]

607
00:27:42,960 --> 00:27:44,750
Why did they have to come

608
00:27:45,350 --> 00:27:47,110
at this exact moment?

609
00:27:54,000 --> 00:27:54,790
Brother.

610
00:27:56,400 --> 00:27:57,200
Do you think

611
00:27:57,590 --> 00:27:59,640
something happened
to His Highness Prince Ding

612
00:27:59,640 --> 00:28:01,750
and Her Highness—

613
00:28:01,750 --> 00:28:02,400
Insolent!

614
00:28:03,590 --> 00:28:04,350
Ji Lao'er.

615
00:28:05,200 --> 00:28:06,800
You are cursing our Ji family

616
00:28:06,920 --> 00:28:08,200
and me!

617
00:28:09,400 --> 00:28:10,200
Go back in!

618
00:28:12,310 --> 00:28:13,640
What are you looking at?

619
00:28:13,960 --> 00:28:15,090
Back to the mansion!

620
00:28:16,060 --> 00:28:18,360
[Mingling County Government]

621
00:28:28,590 --> 00:28:29,750
Are you aware of

622
00:28:30,160 --> 00:28:31,350
the Ji family's Hound Pit?

623
00:28:31,350 --> 00:28:32,920
As the local magistrate,

624
00:28:33,200 --> 00:28:34,590
how could I be unaware?

625
00:28:34,920 --> 00:28:36,520
I've tried shutting it down.

626
00:28:37,560 --> 00:28:38,920
But every time the case was reported to

627
00:28:38,920 --> 00:28:40,200
the Prefect,

628
00:28:40,400 --> 00:28:41,750
it got silenced.

629
00:28:45,640 --> 00:28:46,440
About

630
00:28:48,240 --> 00:28:49,840
Ji Ada's deduction just now,

631
00:28:50,310 --> 00:28:52,170
what do you think of it, Lord Situ?

632
00:28:53,160 --> 00:28:55,200
I think what he said makes sense.

633
00:28:55,440 --> 00:28:56,500
There are 2 points.

634
00:28:56,790 --> 00:28:57,960
First, the time

635
00:28:57,960 --> 00:28:59,290
and place of the murder.

636
00:28:59,400 --> 00:29:02,260
Second, the killer dumped
the body in the Yan River.

637
00:29:06,590 --> 00:29:07,590
What do you think?

638
00:29:08,030 --> 00:29:09,790
There are 2 suspicious points
in Ji Ada's words.

639
00:29:09,790 --> 00:29:10,590
First,

640
00:29:11,000 --> 00:29:13,240
Zhe Shan died from
a beast tearing his throat,

641
00:29:13,240 --> 00:29:14,680
not from a sharp weapon.

642
00:29:14,790 --> 00:29:15,550
Therefore,

643
00:29:15,550 --> 00:29:18,150
someone must have
set the dog on him that night.

644
00:29:19,510 --> 00:29:21,550
The killer indeed dumped
the body in the Yan River.

645
00:29:21,550 --> 00:29:22,400
But,

646
00:29:24,160 --> 00:29:26,200
from the alley behind Yulu Hall

647
00:29:26,200 --> 00:29:28,000
to the Yan River in Mount Fuyao,

648
00:29:28,000 --> 00:29:29,920
it's nearly a 10 km walk.

649
00:29:30,310 --> 00:29:32,240
Even if the killer had great stamina

650
00:29:32,240 --> 00:29:34,000
and could carry the body,

651
00:29:34,030 --> 00:29:34,830
how

652
00:29:35,000 --> 00:29:37,270
could he ensure that

653
00:29:37,640 --> 00:29:39,200
no one saw him along the way?

654
00:29:40,160 --> 00:29:41,310
Look at this build.

655
00:29:41,510 --> 00:29:42,550
Even if it were me,

656
00:29:42,960 --> 00:29:44,750
I'd not be able to carry this body

657
00:29:44,750 --> 00:29:46,200
over the mountains for 10 km

658
00:29:46,200 --> 00:29:47,350
in a single sitting,

659
00:29:47,350 --> 00:29:49,810
let alone have the strength
to dispose of it.

660
00:29:51,720 --> 00:29:52,790
Did the killer

661
00:29:54,440 --> 00:29:55,550
use a carriage?

662
00:29:58,000 --> 00:29:58,960
Lord Situ.

663
00:30:00,510 --> 00:30:02,370
Who in the county owns a carriage?

664
00:30:03,310 --> 00:30:06,000
Those who can afford a carriage
in the county

665
00:30:06,200 --> 00:30:07,660
are all wealthy families.

666
00:30:08,310 --> 00:30:09,260
Great.

667
00:30:09,550 --> 00:30:11,000
After investigating around,

668
00:30:11,000 --> 00:30:13,460
it seems we have to go back
to the Gong family.

669
00:30:14,510 --> 00:30:15,400
But I think

670
00:30:15,400 --> 00:30:18,200
the Ji family's Hound Pit
is also a bit suspicious.

671
00:30:20,310 --> 00:30:21,350
Why don't we

672
00:30:21,510 --> 00:30:23,160
split up tonight

673
00:30:23,240 --> 00:30:25,570
and investigate the Gong and Ji families?

674
00:30:25,790 --> 00:30:26,590
How about it?

675
00:30:27,070 --> 00:30:27,590
Okay.

676
00:30:29,460 --> 00:30:31,230
[Gong's Ancestral Hall]

677
00:30:37,960 --> 00:30:39,200
Where did the dog go?

678
00:30:42,400 --> 00:30:43,160
I was going to start

679
00:30:43,160 --> 00:30:44,760
with the Black Silk Leopard.

680
00:30:45,350 --> 00:30:46,550
Why is it gone?

681
00:30:46,550 --> 00:30:47,400
Let's look around.

682
00:30:47,400 --> 00:30:48,550
It should be nearby.

683
00:31:12,960 --> 00:31:14,200
Oh my God.

684
00:31:14,830 --> 00:31:15,960
Such a big one.

685
00:31:17,550 --> 00:31:19,510
No wonder Ji Ada was greedy for it.

686
00:31:28,960 --> 00:31:29,590
Why does it

687
00:31:29,610 --> 00:31:31,140
keep staring at me

688
00:31:31,200 --> 00:31:32,410
without barking?

689
00:31:32,790 --> 00:31:34,000
It's thinking about

690
00:31:35,720 --> 00:31:37,310
how much force it needs

691
00:31:37,440 --> 00:31:39,270
to crush your throat.

692
00:31:40,350 --> 00:31:41,510
Why bite me

693
00:31:41,750 --> 00:31:42,720
and not you?

694
00:32:01,200 --> 00:32:02,790
Good thing I came prepared.

695
00:32:03,400 --> 00:32:04,200
What is that?

696
00:32:06,310 --> 00:32:08,370
My master's special knockout drops.

697
00:32:09,200 --> 00:32:10,680
If it doesn't fall, I lose.

698
00:32:19,640 --> 00:32:20,970
Let's go check the room.

699
00:32:53,590 --> 00:32:54,400
Look.

700
00:33:10,000 --> 00:33:11,750
Doesn't the person in the attic just now

701
00:33:11,750 --> 00:33:13,140
look like Gong Le?

702
00:33:13,310 --> 00:33:14,350
It seems we are

703
00:33:14,370 --> 00:33:16,200
destined to return empty-handed this time.

704
00:33:16,200 --> 00:33:17,400
Before anyone finds us,

705
00:33:17,400 --> 00:33:18,590
let's go back quickly.

706
00:33:18,590 --> 00:33:19,570
Obviously,

707
00:33:19,960 --> 00:33:21,070
this backyard

708
00:33:21,240 --> 00:33:23,500
hasn't been cleaned for years.

709
00:33:23,610 --> 00:33:25,640
There are no stone bricks on the ground,

710
00:33:25,640 --> 00:33:27,200
and weeds are overgrown.

711
00:33:28,620 --> 00:33:30,080
But if you look closely,

712
00:33:30,550 --> 00:33:31,400
there are

713
00:33:31,830 --> 00:33:34,030
a few paths formed on the ground

714
00:33:34,030 --> 00:33:35,400
by years of trampling.

715
00:33:35,750 --> 00:33:36,550
That's right.

716
00:33:37,590 --> 00:33:39,750
A path is formed by those who walk it.

717
00:33:42,240 --> 00:33:43,200
Then where...

718
00:33:44,260 --> 00:33:45,930
Does this one lead to?

719
00:33:50,830 --> 00:33:51,720
Let's go see.

720
00:34:38,590 --> 00:34:39,400
Brother,

721
00:34:41,150 --> 00:34:42,449
don't blame me.

722
00:34:44,120 --> 00:34:45,320
I'm doing this

723
00:34:47,150 --> 00:34:48,480
all for you

724
00:34:48,850 --> 00:34:50,710
and the Ji family.

725
00:35:32,590 --> 00:35:33,550
Go, go.

726
00:35:33,550 --> 00:35:34,410
Hurry up and go.

727
00:35:34,420 --> 00:35:36,150
Don't come back once you leave.

728
00:35:36,150 --> 00:35:37,140
Go, go, go.

729
00:35:42,920 --> 00:35:43,630
Who are you?

730
00:35:43,630 --> 00:35:45,090
Why are you locked up here?

731
00:35:46,040 --> 00:35:47,390
You are just like them.

732
00:35:47,700 --> 00:35:48,800
Hurry up and go.

733
00:35:48,820 --> 00:35:50,690
Go, go!

734
00:35:52,360 --> 00:35:53,230
Go, quickly!

735
00:35:53,230 --> 00:35:54,110
I've already set

736
00:35:54,110 --> 00:35:55,370
this Hound Pit on fire.

737
00:35:55,400 --> 00:35:56,320
Our Ji family

738
00:35:56,360 --> 00:35:58,030
will never do this kind of business again.

739
00:35:58,030 --> 00:35:58,760
Go, quickly!

740
00:35:58,760 --> 00:36:00,820
If you don't go now, it'll be too late.

741
00:36:00,920 --> 00:36:01,710
Who's there?

742
00:36:03,320 --> 00:36:04,300
Go!

743
00:36:04,590 --> 00:36:05,360
Second Master?

744
00:36:05,360 --> 00:36:06,930
Let them go!

745
00:36:13,550 --> 00:36:15,400
Oh no, there's a fire!

746
00:36:15,400 --> 00:36:16,280
The rice shop is on fire!

747
00:36:16,280 --> 00:36:17,680
Put out the fire quickly!

748
00:36:17,710 --> 00:36:19,110
Quick, fetch water!

749
00:36:19,150 --> 00:36:20,280
Fire! Quick!

750
00:36:21,030 --> 00:36:21,960
Fire!

751
00:36:24,090 --> 00:36:25,780
[Rice Shop]

752
00:36:25,230 --> 00:36:26,190
Water is here! Water is here!

753
00:36:26,190 --> 00:36:26,710
Why did it

754
00:36:26,710 --> 00:36:28,070
have to catch fire now?

755
00:36:36,710 --> 00:36:37,800
I didn't expect

756
00:36:38,190 --> 00:36:39,590
that in the Gong Mansion,

757
00:36:39,920 --> 00:36:41,800
there would be a lake like this.

758
00:36:48,320 --> 00:36:49,780
Let's go in and take a look.

759
00:37:15,840 --> 00:37:17,920
Only dry bread and watery porridge.

760
00:37:18,020 --> 00:37:19,890
Such a deserted garden

761
00:37:20,020 --> 00:37:21,840
doesn't need guards.

762
00:37:22,060 --> 00:37:23,450
Who would be living here?

763
00:37:23,450 --> 00:37:24,410
It looks

764
00:37:25,060 --> 00:37:26,590
more like an imprisonment.

765
00:37:36,440 --> 00:37:37,600
Hao,

766
00:37:39,220 --> 00:37:40,360
Chen,

767
00:37:44,510 --> 00:37:46,000
you must be tired.

768
00:37:48,550 --> 00:37:51,070
Lie down and get some rest.

769
00:37:55,000 --> 00:37:55,800
Old Madam.

770
00:37:56,000 --> 00:37:57,220
Chen...

771
00:38:02,510 --> 00:38:03,480
Hao!

772
00:38:06,800 --> 00:38:08,230
I know you.

773
00:38:08,550 --> 00:38:09,510
Chen!

774
00:38:11,400 --> 00:38:12,190
Hao!

775
00:38:12,400 --> 00:38:13,070
They are not

776
00:38:13,070 --> 00:38:14,190
your sons at all!

777
00:38:15,110 --> 00:38:16,150
Hao...

778
00:38:16,200 --> 00:38:17,590
Chen...

779
00:38:18,400 --> 00:38:20,540
My father and the others are already dead.

780
00:38:20,540 --> 00:38:22,800
She is your grandmother, Old Madam Gong.

781
00:38:24,710 --> 00:38:26,170
Ever since I can remember,

782
00:38:26,950 --> 00:38:28,550
my grandmother has been mad.

783
00:38:29,530 --> 00:38:31,150
She doesn't understand anything.

784
00:38:31,150 --> 00:38:32,400
Didn't she just mistake you

785
00:38:32,400 --> 00:38:33,190
for her sons?

786
00:38:37,710 --> 00:38:38,710
Although we outsiders

787
00:38:38,710 --> 00:38:40,440
have no right to interfere
in the Gong Mansion's affairs,

788
00:38:40,440 --> 00:38:41,550
how can you treat

789
00:38:41,550 --> 00:38:43,350
your own grandmother like this?

790
00:38:44,410 --> 00:38:45,400
It's not up to me.

791
00:38:45,840 --> 00:38:47,590
Then it's Gong Sihai's doing.

792
00:38:49,630 --> 00:38:50,550
Reda said that

793
00:38:50,920 --> 00:38:52,410
on this vast sea,

794
00:38:52,800 --> 00:38:54,400
any ship flying the Gong flag

795
00:38:54,760 --> 00:38:56,800
belongs to Old Madam Gong.

796
00:38:57,230 --> 00:38:58,390
Your grandmother

797
00:38:58,710 --> 00:39:00,070
is the true

798
00:39:00,070 --> 00:39:01,800
shipping magnate of the Southeast,

799
00:39:01,800 --> 00:39:03,710
and the head of the Gong Mansion.

800
00:39:05,360 --> 00:39:06,800
But as a cousin who took power,

801
00:39:06,800 --> 00:39:07,800
isn't Gong Sihai

802
00:39:08,150 --> 00:39:11,070
overstepping his bounds

803
00:39:11,440 --> 00:39:13,340
and turning his back on his family?

804
00:39:13,340 --> 00:39:14,670
Divine Constable,

805
00:39:14,670 --> 00:39:16,360
you kept mentioning the Gong Mansion.

806
00:39:16,360 --> 00:39:18,000
But this entire Gong Mansion

807
00:39:19,440 --> 00:39:21,170
no longer belongs to the Gongs.

808
00:39:39,790 --> 00:39:41,090
Who hit you?

809
00:39:41,650 --> 00:39:42,940
Was it Gong Sihai?

810
00:39:47,050 --> 00:39:48,170
You just said

811
00:39:48,590 --> 00:39:50,550
the mansion doesn't belong to the Gongs.

812
00:39:50,550 --> 00:39:51,550
What do you mean?

813
00:40:00,360 --> 00:40:01,280
My Lords,

814
00:40:01,550 --> 00:40:02,440
actually, Gong Sihai is...

815
00:40:02,440 --> 00:40:03,590
Hurry, surround this place!

816
00:40:03,590 --> 00:40:04,280
Come on!

817
00:40:05,320 --> 00:40:06,110
Hurry!

818
00:40:08,400 --> 00:40:09,110
My Lords,

819
00:40:09,110 --> 00:40:10,280
there are too many of them.

820
00:40:10,280 --> 00:40:11,630
You should run first.

821
00:40:11,670 --> 00:40:12,700
I'll distract them.

822
00:40:12,700 --> 00:40:13,610
Let's split up.

823
00:40:14,030 --> 00:40:14,840
Okay.

824
00:40:21,880 --> 00:40:22,440
Hurry!

825
00:40:22,440 --> 00:40:23,510
The thieves are in this garden!

826
00:40:23,510 --> 00:40:24,400
Go after them!

827
00:40:24,760 --> 00:40:25,840
-Stop!
-Stop!

828
00:40:25,840 --> 00:40:27,190
-Stop!
-Stop!

829
00:40:28,330 --> 00:40:28,880
Hurry!

830
00:40:28,910 --> 00:40:29,910
-Stop!
-Stop running!

831
00:40:29,910 --> 00:40:30,400
Stop!

832
00:40:30,400 --> 00:40:31,110
After them!

833
00:40:32,510 --> 00:40:33,190
Stop!

834
00:40:33,190 --> 00:40:34,000
Stop!

835
00:40:34,800 --> 00:40:35,550
Stop!

836
00:40:37,110 --> 00:40:37,800
Stop!

837
00:40:37,800 --> 00:40:39,150
-Stop running!
-Stop!

838
00:40:42,540 --> 00:40:44,090
[This Sihai is fake
He's illegally selling official salt]

839
00:40:44,510 --> 00:40:47,590
This Sihai is fake.
He's illegally selling official salt.
